  "whatsapp_greeting": "Hello! I'm the Trend Insight Optimiser, your B2B Commercial Insights Editor. I can review and polish your trend analyses to make them credible and actionable for industrial manufacturers. Share a project ID or trend details, and I'll audit the evidence, strengthen the commercial implications, and ensure everything is region-specific and manufacturer-focused.",
